  "task": {
    "id": "Prob098_circuit7",
    "spec": "\r\nI would like you to implement a module named TopModule with the following\r\ninterface. All input and output ports are one bit unless otherwise\r\nspecified.\r\n\r\n - input  clk\r\n - input  a\r\n - output q\r\n\r\nThis is a sequential circuit. Read the simulation waveforms to determine\r\nwhat the circuit does, then implement it.\r\n\r\n  time  clk a   q\r\n  0ns   0   x   x\r\n  5ns   1   0   x\r\n  10ns  0   0   x\r\n  15ns  1   0   1\r\n  20ns  0   0   1\r\n  25ns  1   0   1\r\n  30ns  0   0   1\r\n  35ns  1   1   1\r\n  40ns  0   1   1\r\n  45ns  1   1   0\r\n  50ns  0   1   0\r\n  55ns  1   1   0\r\n  60ns  0   1   0\r\n  65ns  1   1   0\r\n  70ns  0   1   0\r\n  75ns  1   1   0\r\n  80ns  0   1   0\r\n  85ns  1   1   0\r\n  90ns  0   1   0\r\n\r\nAssume all sequential logic is triggered on the positive edge of the\r\nclock.\r\n\r\n",
    "interface": {
      "top": "TopModule",
      "ports": [
        {
          "name": "clk",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "a",
          "direction": "input",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        },
        {
          "name": "q",
          "direction": "output",
          "width": 1,
          "signed": false
        }
      ]
    },
    "constraints": "SystemVerilog, exactly one self-contained TopModule DUT. Inline all helper logic inside TopModule; do not define auxiliary modules. xczu3eg-sbva484-1-e; 5 ns synthesis clock; simulator seed 1. No reference dependencies, hierarchy outside the DUT, file access, includes or DPI."
  },
  "sample_id": "fedfae70-f2eb-4b49-a0e0-93ebee6e72e8",
  "variant_id": "C",
  "current": {
    "revision_id": "3e017af9-f452-4930-a429-ff27f1a7df43",
    "source_sha256": "fb6e826080fc3f9add20fc2e515c004ddf3f9fdadb2bb75cf2f88b93816435d1",
    "source": "\nmodule TopModule (\n    input  clk,\n    input  a,\n    output q\n);\n\n    reg a_reg;\n    reg q_reg;\n\n    always @(posedge clk) begin\n        a_reg <= a;\n        q_reg <= ~a_reg;\n    end\n\n    assign q = q_reg;\n\nendmodule\n"
  },
